"""
IQ Puzzler Pro - hint helper (straight 11 x 5 board and diagonal board)

1. PICK    : choose the board layout (straight or diagonal), then either a puzzle
           card (straight cards 1-40, diagonal cards 41-80) or "Free play" (empty
           board).  The pieces printed on a card are fixed (dark outline).
2. PLAY    : drag the other pieces from the tray onto the board.  Right-click / R /
           mouse wheel = rotate, F = flip, Undo = take back the last piece.
3. HINTS   : press "Hint" at any time - it looks at what is on the board right now
           and shows the most forced piece next (gold outline) with a plain-language
           reason.  Press it again for the next step, or "Solution" to see every
           remaining piece.  If your pieces can't be completed, it tells you.

Only the Python standard library is used (Python 3.8+ with tkinter).
Run:   python iq_puzzler_helper.py

The piece shapes in DEFAULT_PIECES were read from the game's solution picture.
If one is ever wrong, fix it under Pieces > Edit piece shapes...; edits are saved
next to this script in iq_puzzler_pieces_v2.json.
"""
